$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2fin0t  LOC_AFTER=?

* The second exit of a three-way pop-branch loop: the popped letter ` Z ` fails both tests, so the machine pushes two letters on the source stack ` K ` and leaves.  Lean: ` incLoop_loop ` case 1 --- the terminator is pushed back and a one above it, which is the carry running off the top of the number.  The continue branch ` Q ` and the middle branch ` R ` are class variables.

